	(text "Clamp static from the cable or a finger to GND before it reaches the hub or the CC comparators.\nD+/D-: H5VUD5BB, 0.3 pF (fine at 480 Mbit/s). CC: H7VL10B, 7 V working (CC can sit near 5.5 V).\nVBUS: SMF6.0A, above VBUS's 5.5 V max. Place all five right at the receptacle." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 192.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3477a574-dd05-513a-94b6-671b82be0dd9"))
